      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there isn't a \"new sense of self\"? what if that's the point? the person i was is the only person i ever liked. now i'm just a broken machine, a collection of parts that don't work together anymore. it feels less like a \"chapter\" and more like the whole book just ended, and i'm just... stuck on the last page. it feels so wrong to keep dragging this lifeless weight around when the essence of me is already gone.",
